Description: Simplify and harden avformat consumer startup synchronization
 Partially revert the previous start/stop synchronization change:
 remove lifecycle serialization and the self-stop special case while
 retaining the worker startup handshake.
 .
 Handle synchronization and thread allocation failures, join a previous
 worker before restarting, and restore the property listener when no
 worker is created.
 .
 Document consumer lifecycle expectations and add tests for startup
 success, failure recovery, repeated use, and format-list cleanup.
 .
 Carried without the commit's additions to
 src/tests/test_mod_avformat/test_mod_avformat.cpp, which need the test file of
 the later tree; the changes to the library are upstream's, unchanged.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/mltframework/mlt/commit/ff691621534f7d1f9d1111adf3f3d3cc7a4a2db0
Author: Brian Matherly
Bug: https://github.com/mltframework/mlt/issues/1333
Applied-Upstream: master after v7.42.0, https://github.com/mltframework/mlt/pull/1366 (merged 2026-11-22 as be583ee302a26ea24d0a5ddb1ec01c5191063ec3)
Last-Update: 2026-11-26

